learnings:
  - The learning loop was gated behind parentTaskId settlement + a verdict early-return with no liveness invariant — broken was byte-identical to healthy. Fix = settleLeafTask + postflight-liveness.jsonl + doctor metric. 'Steal Headroom's trigger, keep Paradigm's gate.'
  - 'Headroom verdict: complement-in-tech, competitor-in-NARRATIVE. Moat intact. Do NOT adopt the compression engine (fail-closed thesis). The threat is the two front-page words: ''context-efficient'' + ''learning''.'
  - 'npm install -g broke on @a-company/warpline 404: it was a HARD dep but EXCLUDED from the bundle (typescript/ESM) AND intermittently unpublished. npm link masked it. Fix = optionalDependency (npm tolerates the 404; code degrades gracefully via lazy try/caught imports).'
  - 'No MCP client except Claude Code expands ${VAR} in the mcp env block (verified: Cursor/Cline/Continue/Claude Desktop/VS Code all don''t) — so the Claude-Code-only PATH augmentation is correct and cannot be safely extended.'
  - Independent re-verification caught a real defect each round (HOME-pollution in loop-closure tests; the risky 4-client env scope). 'The team built it' is not a gate — falsifiers and independent verification are.
